Topic: Rapid Fire Interview + Stress Handling 🎤⚡

👉 This is where many good candidates fail
👉 IO checks: Can you stay calm under pressure?

🎯 WHAT IS RAPID FIRE?

👉 IO asks 8–12 questions continuously
👉 You must:

Listen carefully
Remember all
Answer in sequence
⚠️ RULES (IMPORTANT)
Don’t panic
Don’t interrupt
Answer in order
If you miss → admit honestly
🎤 ROUND 1 – RAPID FIRE (REAL SSB STYLE)

👉 Answer ALL in sequence:

1️⃣ Tell me about your daily routine
2️⃣ Your favorite subject and why
3️⃣ Your least favorite subject and why
4️⃣ What do your parents expect from you?
5️⃣ Your biggest achievement
6️⃣ One failure in life
7️⃣ What did you learn from hockey? 🏑
8️⃣ How do your friends describe you?
9️⃣ What will you do if not selected?
🔟 Why should we select you?

⏱️ CONDITION

👉 Answer in one flow (like speaking)
👉 Not separate bullet answers

🧠 WHAT IO CHECKS
Memory
Confidence
Clarity
Honesty
Consistency
🔥 STRESS TWIST

👉 After answering, also answer:

👉 “You seem average in academics, why should we trust your capability?”

🧠 PRO STRATEGY

If stuck:
👉 Stay calm
👉 Say:
“Sir, I may have missed one question, I will answer what I remember”

💥 Honesty > perfection

🎯 YOUR TASK

👉 Send:

Rapid fire answers (in order)
Stress question answer
🧠 WHAT I WILL DO
Evaluate like IO
Show weak areas
Upgrade to recommended-level answers
🔥 REAL TRUTH

👉 SSB doesn’t reject weak candidates
👉 It rejects confused candidates
